; diag-track-source: a track carrying BOTH (key …) children and :expr is a
; track_source_conflict — a track has exactly one value source (keys XOR
; expr XOR pattern). Pins the code number, span (on the conflicting track
; form), and message across native == wasm. Load fails; times never run.
(transport :bpm 120)
(track :target radius
  :expr (+ beat 0)
  (key :at 0b :value 0.2))
